update.summary:
I updated the cover, the preface, chapters 1–2 and chapter 3 from v0.1.3 to v0.1.6. I kept all heading ids and the chapter numbering. The only new section is 3.9, added at the end of chapter 3, so the 3.1, 3.2, 3.6 and 3.7 references from other chapters still point to the right place. I checked every UI string against app.py, utils/gpu.py, engine.py, workflows.py, cli.py, default_config.yaml and install_windows.ps1. I did not run git and did not build the PDF.

**Cover (01_cover.html)**
- Version is now v0.1.6 and the date is 2026 年 10 月.
- The ②/③ step cards now say "按显卡自动定好参数 / 自动挑出最像你的模型" and "每句标出"像你本人"百分比".
- Two feature bullets changed: "真实界面截图，进度条一看就懂" and "机器鉴别与观众盲听测试".

**Preface (01_front.html)**
- The quick-start link now says "几页长" instead of "4 页".
- New reading tip: "以前装过旧版本 → 3.9 节".
- 关于截图 now says the screenshots come from a demo computer (RTX 4070 12GB) with a demo voice. So the similarity %, times, counts, paths and version numbers are only examples, and the % may be low.
- 适用版本 is v0.1.6 and mentions the version number shown in the page title.

**Chapter 1**
- 1.1: removed the overclaim "音色和前后完全一致".
- 1.2 table updated:
  - clips are 2–12 s (matches min/max_duration in the config);
  - typos are marked red;
  - training settings are chosen automatically from GPU memory, with an automatic retry if memory runs out;
  - candidates per tier: 3 / 5 / 8, up to 20 for 完美;
  - new row for the calibrated "像你本人（%）" score, with 85% elimination;
  - pauses are fully silent (no background, no noise floor), lengths follow the user's habits; nothing about copying the old recording's background sound.
- 1.3:
  - quality tier: 完美 is the default at 8GB or more, and higher tiers cannot go beyond what the trained model can do;
  - the % is an automatic score and the ears decide;
  - the 85% rule, including the "低于 85%，建议重新生成或改写这一句" flag and the ⚠️ note when only the rough fallback score is available (nothing is eliminated then);
  - the two 完美 versions A/B, with ⭐ 推荐;
  - a pointer to ④ and ⑤ in chapter 12.
- 1.4:
  - flow boxes renamed to match the tabs: 安装 → ① 准备素材 → ② 训练模型 → ③ 生成讲课音频;
  - ⑤ 鉴别 mentioned as optional;
  - new note box explaining the GPU badge and the progress-bar colours, and that closing the page does not stop the task.
- 1.5 glossary: the old "声纹相似度 0.86" row is replaced by "像你本人（%）"; added a 质量档位 row; the 显存 row mentions the badge.

**Chapter 2**
- 2.1 notes that 8GB or more means 完美 is the default.
- 2.2 has a new tip about the green / yellow / red badge and 🔄 重新检查显卡, with 图 2-1 (00_gpu_badge.png).
- 2.4 has a new box for RTX 50 cards (needs the nvidia50 package) and a line saying a red badge means: install the driver, restart, then 🔄 重新检查显卡.
- 2.6: the VoiceTwin download size is now "十几 MB".

**Chapter 3**
- 3.1: zip name is v0.1.6.
- 3.4: I rewrote the installer screen examples to match the real install_windows.ps1, because the old ones were out of date:
  - steps are now shown as 【第 1/6 步】 … 【第 6/6 步】;
  - the installer finds the GPT-SoVITS folder by itself ("找到了整合包：…", press Enter);
  - step 3 now also installs noisereduce;
  - it may ask whether to download missing models now;
  - the numbered check list starts with "环境检查结果（共 N 项）";
  - it ends with "✅ 安装成功！…" and "现在就打开声音分身吗？".
- 3.5:
  - explains the numbered results and the "可选，不用管" rows, and that without noisereduce there is no version B;
  - the missing-model fix now points to 🩺 环境检查 → "⬇️ 下载缺少的模型";
  - describes the web page: # / 状态 / 项目 / 说明, "共 N 项", the folded optional list, and 🔄 重新检查（约 10~30 秒）;
  - adds 图 3-1 (10_doctor.png). The caption says it is the demo machine's result, with different paths and versions.
- 3.6:
  - 方法一 (recommended) uses the web button: progress bar → "✅ 已下载 N 个文件，可以开始训练了" → re-check → "✅ 一切正常，可以开始使用";
  - 方法二 keeps the `voicetwin.bat download-models --source hf-mirror` command line, plus the tip about switching to v2.
- 3.8: install_windows.bat is now also described as the tool for upgrading.
- New 3.9 从旧版本升级:
  1. Close the program, then extract the new zip into D:\ and choose "替换目标中的文件".
  2. Run install_windows.bat, type 1, then press Enter at "上次用的整合包：D:\GPT-SoVITS" (or type the path).
  3. The page title shows v0.1.6.
  - A note explains why nothing is lost: workspace stays in D:\VoiceTwin, trained models stay in D:\GPT-SoVITS, and config.yaml is kept.

Size: chapters 1–2 grew by about 5 KB and chapter 3 by about 6 KB, roughly 3 more PDF pages in total.
